    "intro_narrative": "You wake up in the dimly lit study of the infamous cryptographer, Elias Thorne. The heavy oak door behind you is sealed shut with an incredibly complex mechanical lock. Thorne was known for his eccentric paranoia, hiding his greatest secrets behind layers of obscure mathematical puzzles and interconnected devices. As you look around the room, you see strange, antique calculating machines, digital archives, and brass-rimmed terminals. Your objective is clear: you must deduce the correct sequence of operations, decipher the hidden connections between these arcane devices, and feed the correct final sequence into the lock to escape before time runs out. Every machine in this room is a piece of a larger puzzle, with information flowing from one contraption to another. Pay close attention to the mechanisms.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
